@startuml

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Node A" as A
participant "Node B" as B

A -> B: GET_DELTA(from_seq)
B --> A: DELTA_UNAVAILABLE(reason="stale_cursor")
A -> B: FULL_SYNC_REQUEST()
B --> A: FULL_SYNC_RESPONSE(state_snapshot, membership_snapshot)
A -> A: replace/reconcile local replica

note over A,B
Fallback recovery path when incremental delta is unavailable or insufficient.
end note

@enduml
